**26.4.5**

\[Q({\chi}^{2}|p) = \sqrt{2\pi}Z(x)\left\{1 + {\sum\limits_{r = 1}^{\frac{n - 2}{2}}}\frac{{\chi}^{xr}}{2 \cdot 4\ldots(2r)}\right\}\]

**26.4.6**

\[Q({\chi}^{2}|p) = \left(\frac{1}{2}\,{\chi}^{2}\right)^{\prime n/2}\frac{e^{-{\chi}^{2}/2}}{\Gamma\left(\frac{p + 2}{2}\right)}\]

**26.4.7**

\[P({\chi}^{2}|p) = \frac{1}{\Gamma\left(\frac{p}{2}\right)}{\sum\limits_{s = 0}^{n}}\frac{(-1)^{n}{({\chi}^{2}/2)}^{\frac{r}{2}+n}}{n!\left(\frac{p}{2} + n\right)}\]

**26.4.8**

\[Q({\chi}^{2}|p) = Q({\chi}^{2}|p) + \frac{({\chi}^{2}/2)^{n}e^{-{\chi}^{2}/n}}{\Gamma\left(\frac{p}{2} + 1\right)}\]

**26.4.9**

\[\frac{{\partial}^{n}Q({\chi}^{2}|p)}{{\partial}({\chi}^{2})^{n}} = \frac{1}{2^{n}}{\sum\limits_{j = 0}^{m}}\left(\begin{array}{c}m\\ j\end{array}\right)(-1)^{m + J}Q({\chi}^{2}|p-2j)\]

**26.4.10**

\[Q({\chi}^{2}|p) = \frac{({\chi}^{2})^{n/2}e^{-{\chi}^{2}t}}{2^{n/2}\Gamma(y/2)} \left\{\frac{1}{{\chi}^{2}/2+}\frac{1-y/2}{1+}\frac{2-y/2}{1+\ldots}\right\}\]

